LEFT BEHIND 被落下的伞 — Pictogram Motion (象形运动图形) demo of the Lemo-Opuscar library
LemoLab × Claude Opus 5.5

Picture
- Made entirely in code (Canvas2D): engine.js, film.js. No generated images, no photos, no third-party artwork.
- No real event, city, brand, logo or slogan appears. "Line 4", the street names, the depot and the number 313 are fiction.

